{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-60","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Jung und Alt 3","bn":"নবীন ও প্রবীণ ৩"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„versprechen“ মানে কী?","options":["প্রতিশ্রুতি দেওয়া","আলোচনা করা","ভয় করা"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-60-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„aufpassen“ মানে কী?","options":["অবাক করা","খেয়াল রাখা","সংরক্ষণ করা"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-60-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Kannst du heute auf die Kinder ___? (খেয়াল রাখা)","options":["aufbewahren","verpassen","aufpassen"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-60-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich habe den Bus ___. (মিস করা)","options":["verpasst","versprochen","verlassen"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-60-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir wollen die Oma zum Geburtstag ___. (অবাক করা)","options":["fürchten","überraschen","besprechen"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-60-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Meine Oma ___ alte Fotos in einem Schrank auf. (সংরক্ষণ করা)","options":["passt","bearbeitet","bewahrt"],"answer":2,"explanation":"aufbewahren: bewahrt … auf।","id":"b1-practice-60-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er hat mir versprochen, dass er pünktlich kommt.“ মানে কী?","options":["সে আমাকে কথা দিয়েছে যে সময়মতো আসবে।","সে বলেছে যে সে দেরিতে আসবে।","সে আমাকে জিজ্ঞেস করেছে কখন আসবে।"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-60-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Zug kommt ___ zu spät. (সম্ভবত)","options":["tagsüber","wahrscheinlich","jahrelang"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-60-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Je mehr mein Opa liest, ___ mehr weiß er.","options":["als","dass","desto"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-60-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Obwohl meine Oma sehr alt ___, wohnt sie nicht im Pflegeheim.","options":["wäre","sei","ist"],"answer":2,"explanation":"বাস্তব তথ্য → ist; obwohl-এর অংশে শেষে।","id":"b1-practice-60-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das ist die Frau, ___ ich im Altersheim besuche.","options":["die","der","den"],"answer":0,"explanation":"besuchen + Akkusativ: die Frau → die।","id":"b1-practice-60-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wenn ich mehr Zeit ___, würde ich meine Oma öfter besuchen.","options":["hatte","hätte","habe"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-60-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Nachdem wir alles besprochen ___, gingen wir nach Hause.","options":["haben","waren","hatten"],"answer":2,"explanation":"অতীতের আগের কাজ → Plusquamperfekt।","id":"b1-practice-60-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Mein Opa tut so, als ob er nichts ___.","options":["hören würde","hört würde","gehört würde"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-60-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Haus ___ von meinem Urgroßvater gebaut.","options":["wird gewesen","wurde","würde"],"answer":1,"explanation":"অতীতের Passiv: wurde … gebaut।","id":"b1-practice-60-q15"}],"requires":{"grammar":36,"vocabulary":38}},"schema":1,"id":"b1-practice-60","level":"B1","test":[]}